{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "donatrack-flujo-01-catalogo-personas",
    "name": "Flujo 1 - Catálogo y Personas (donaciones-service)",
    "description": "Flujo autocontenido: crea una Categoría → Subcategoría (con alias) → Persona Humana (donante) → Donante → Persona Jurídica (entidad) → Entidad Beneficiaria. Es la base de datos mínima que necesitan los flujos 2, 3, 4 y 8 — correlo primero si vas a testear el resto a mano y querés IDs frescos.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "categoriaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "subcategoriaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "personaDonanteId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "donanteId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "personaJuridicaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "entidadId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Crear Categoría (Alimentos)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('categoriaId', json.id);",
              "pm.test('Status 201 Created', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
              "pm.test('Tiene id', function () { pm.expect(json.id).to.be.a('string'); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Alimentos QA\",\n  \"conUso\": false,\n  \"conVencimiento\": true,\n  \"unidad\": \"UNIDADES\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/categorias",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "categorias"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Crear Subcategoría (Fideos Larga Vida)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('subcategoriaId', json.id);",
              "pm.test('Status 201 Created', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Subcategoria Sintetica F1\",\n  \"idCategoria\": \"{{categoriaId}}\",\n  \"aliases\": [\n    { \"alias\": \"zzqf1token\" }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/subcategorias",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "subcategorias"
          ]
        },
        "description": "El alias es un token sintético (zzqf1...), no una palabra real: donaciones-service siembra 8 subcategorías fijas en cada arranque (No Perecederos: arroz/fideos/alimentos..., Frutas, Ropa..., Muebles...) y cualquier alias con una palabra real corre riesgo de matchear contra esas — o contra la subcategoría de OTRO flujo que corra sobre el mismo backend compartido. Este flujo no crea ninguna Donación, así que el alias no se usa para auto-normalizar acá, pero igual se mantiene único para no ensuciar el catálogo global para flujos que corran después."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Crear Persona Humana (futuro donante)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('personaDonanteId', json.id);",
              "pm.test('Status 201 Created', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"tipo\": \"HUMANA\",\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"DNI\",\n  \"documento\": \"{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"nombre\": \"QA\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Donante\",\n  \"genero\": \"HOMBRE\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"1995-05-15\",\n  \"mediosDeContacto\": [\n    {\n      \"tipo\": \"CORREO\",\n      \"esPredeterminado\": true,\n      \"direccionCorreo\": \"qa.donante.{{$timestamp}}@example.com\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"direccion\": {\n    \"calle\": \"Av. Medrano\",\n    \"altura\": 951,\n    \"codigoPostal\": \"1179\",\n    \"localidad\": \"CABA\",\n    \"provincia\": \"CABA\",\n    \"pais\": \"Argentina\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/personas",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "personas"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Crear Donante",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('donanteId', json.idDonante);",
              "pm.test('Status 201 Created', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
              "pm.test('Tiene idDonante', function () { pm.expect(json.idDonante).to.be.a('string'); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"idPersona\": \"{{personaDonanteId}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/donantes",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donantes"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Crear Persona Jurídica (futura entidad)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('personaJuridicaId', json.id);",
              "pm.test('Status 201 Created', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"tipo\": \"JURIDICA\",\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"CUIT\",\n  \"documento\": \"30-{{$timestamp}}-3\",\n  \"razonSocial\": \"Comedor QA {{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"tipoJuridico\": \"ONG\",\n  \"rubro\": \"Comedor\",\n  \"representantes\": [\n    {\n      \"tipo\": \"HUMANA\",\n      \"tipoDocumento\": \"DNI\",\n      \"documento\": \"{{$timestamp}}\",\n      \"nombre\": \"Representante\",\n      \"apellido\": \"QA\",\n      \"genero\": \"MUJER\",\n      \"fechaNacimiento\": \"1980-01-01\",\n      \"mediosDeContacto\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"mediosDeContacto\": [\n    {\n      \"tipo\": \"CORREO\",\n      \"esPredeterminado\": true,\n      \"direccionCorreo\": \"qa.comedor.{{$timestamp}}@example.com\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"direccion\": {\n    \"calle\": \"Av. Medrano\",\n    \"altura\": 951,\n    \"codigoPostal\": \"1179\",\n    \"localidad\": \"CABA\",\n    \"provincia\": \"CABA\",\n    \"pais\": \"Argentina\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/personas",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "personas"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Crear Entidad Beneficiaria",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('entidadId', json.id);",
              "pm.test('Status 201 Created', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"juridicaId\": \"{{personaJuridicaId}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/entidades",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "entidades"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. [Negativo] Persona Jurídica sin representantes",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 400 Bad Request', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(400); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"tipo\": \"JURIDICA\",\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"CUIT\",\n  \"documento\": \"30-{{$timestamp}}-4\",\n  \"razonSocial\": \"Comedor Sin Representante {{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"tipoJuridico\": \"ONG\",\n  \"rubro\": \"Comedor\",\n  \"representantes\": [],\n  \"mediosDeContacto\": [],\n  \"direccion\": {\n    \"calle\": \"Av. Medrano\",\n    \"altura\": 951,\n    \"codigoPostal\": \"1179\",\n    \"localidad\": \"CABA\",\n    \"provincia\": \"CABA\",\n    \"pais\": \"Argentina\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/personas",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "personas"
          ]
        },
        "description": "JURIDICA_SIN_REPRESENTANTE_INICIAL — regla de dominio, no de bean validation. El DTO no exige el array, pero el constructor de Juridica sí."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. [Negativo] Entidad Beneficiaria con persona Humana",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 400 Bad Request', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(400); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"juridicaId\": \"{{personaDonanteId}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/entidades",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "entidades"
          ]
        },
        "description": "ENTIDAD_BENEFICIARIA_SIN_PERSONA_JURIDICA — usa personaDonanteId (Humana) donde se espera una Jurídica."
      }
    }
  ]
}
